xMDY1MjQwLTMz/MDMuanBlZw.jpeg","profile":"Robin Albers obtained a degree in commercial studies and was a member of the Dutch national baseball team and triple Dutch wrestling champion (in the category up to 70 kilos).\r\n\r\nIn the seventies Albers was one of the first mixing DJ's in Holland. He played in clubs all over the country and later went on to Dutch national radio, where for 11 years he had his own show. Five times he organized the annual Dutch Mixing Championship, and in the past years he hosted various music and sports programs on national TV. He performed in Denmark, Italy, Germany and Belgium, spun at Amsterdam's renowned Club, and at many major raves in Holland. \r\n\r\nFor three consecutive years his radio show For Those Who Like To Groove got elected Best Dutch Dance Show - a unique accomplishment for which in 1992 he received an industry award. Besides his musical activities as Jaydee, Robin also has his own label, First Impression, and his Club in Vianen (near Utrecht).\r\n\r\nrobinjaydee [at] gmail [dot] com","provider":"discogs","ref":"discogs:artist:892","relations":{"aliases":[{"id":6480,"name":"Graylock"},{"id":7231,"name":"Daydream"},{"id":33441,"name":"S.U.A.D."},{"id":38691,"name":"Sax 4 Two"},{"id":38833,"name":"Cyberhouse"},{"id":55531,"name":"Karnak"},{"id":58396,"name":"Master Mind (2)"},{"id":76356,"name":"Robin Albers"},{"id":98605,"name":"Chemistry (3)"},{"id":158130,"name":"Inside The Secret"}],"groups":null,"members":null,"namevariations":["J.D.","JD","Jadee","Jahdee","Jatdee","Jay Dee","Jay-Dee","Jayde","Jaydee@company.diva.nl","Jaydes","Jayydee","Joy Dee","Joy Du","Robin \"Jaydee\" Albers"]},"schemaVersion":2,"sourceUrl":"https://www.discogs.com/artist/892-Jaydee","type":"artist","urls":["http://www.facebook.com/jaydeeofficialpage","","http://twitter.com/robinjaydee","http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jaydee","http://www.youtube.com/user/ralbers2009"]}},"/api/discogs/artist/9741/profile":{"cached":true,"profile":{"id":"9741","image":"